<title>UK: IBC says Q1 results up on last year.</title>
<headline>IBC says Q1 results up on last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBC Group Plc said on Wednesday that first quarter results exceeded those in the first quarter of the previous year.</p>
